#: 814507c85be2409bb608f637b8288cb7
msgid "The `uBlox GPS + Compass Module <https://erlerobotics.com/blog/product/gpscompass-ublox-neo-m8n-gps-with-compass-kit/>`__ is the recommended GPS for Erle-Brain2. The GPS port is connected with the six-position DF13 cable, and the Compass port is connected to the I2C port with the four-position DF13 cable, as shown in the :ref:`wiring chart above <common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start_erle-brain2_wiring_chart>`."
